DTSTAMP:20250601T230000Z
UID:CnETMjwdVB
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 162 mins (2h42m)\n\nAkira Kurosawa’s Academy Award
 -winning adaptation of William Shakespeare’s "King Lear\," Ran consider
 s the disastrous consequences of Lord Hidetora Ichimonji’s (Tatsuya Naka
 dai) decision to split his kingdom among his three sons. 40th Anniversary.
 \n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-theaters/ran
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Downtown\, 2100 4th Avenue
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:There is Another Way
DTSTART:20250601T234500Z
DTEND:20250602T014000Z
DTSTAMP:20250601T234500Z
UID:H9Tt1w1vTY
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 92 mins (1h32m)\n\nIn the midst of darkness\, we dis
 cover who we truly are. There is Another Way tells the story of a group of
  visionaries who refuse to surrender to violence and injustice\, and in do
 ing so show that another path is possible—for them\, for us\, and for al
 l humanity. Director Stephen Apkon scheduled to attend for a post-film Q&
 A on May 31.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-theaters/there-is-another-w
 ay
LOCATION:SIFF Film Center\, 305 Harrison Street
END:VEVENT
