BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Pink Flamingos
DTSTART:20250627T023000Z
DTEND:20250627T042500Z
DTSTAMP:20250627T023000Z
UID:ta227YjR2i
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 93 mins (1h33m)\n\nUnstreamable Notorious Baltimore 
 criminal and underground figure Divine goes up against Connie & Raymond Ma
 rble\, a sleazy married couple who make a passionate attempt to humiliate 
 her and seize her tabloid-given title as “The Filthiest Person Alive”.
  Members: Make sure to sign in to your SIFF account before selecting a sho
 wtime.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/programs-and-events/unstreamable/pink-flami
 ngos
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 3\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:We Ride Why
DTSTART:20250629T023000Z
DTEND:20250629T040000Z
DTSTAMP:20250629T023000Z
UID:Du4sUpKw4u
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 70 mins (1h10m)\n\nPresented by Noir Rouge Producti
 ons. We Ride Why is a documentary film about the power of love\, community
 \, and hope in the face of cancer. The film follows the stories of several
  women who have been impacted by cancer\, as well as the friends and famil
 y who support them. Through their stories\, we learn about the collateral 
 damage that cancer can bring\, but also the hope that can be found in the 
 relationships that are born out of trauma. We also see how a strong commu
 nity in Seattle\, Washington has formed to support all those impacted by c
 ancer.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-theaters/we-ride-why
LOCATION:SIFF Film Center\, 305 Harrison Street
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:We Ride Why
DTSTART:20250630T023000Z
DTEND:20250630T040000Z
DTSTAMP:20250630T023000Z
UID:eCvxvJ1WdE
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 70 mins (1h10m)\n\nPresented by Noir Rouge Producti
 ons. We Ride Why is a documentary film about the power of love\, community
 \, and hope in the face of cancer. The film follows the stories of several
  women who have been impacted by cancer\, as well as the friends and famil
 y who support them. Through their stories\, we learn about the collateral 
 damage that cancer can bring\, but also the hope that can be found in the 
 relationships that are born out of trauma. We also see how a strong commu
 nity in Seattle\, Washington has formed to support all those impacted by c
 ancer.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-theaters/we-ride-why
LOCATION:SIFF Film Center\, 305 Harrison Street
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Jurassic World Rebirth
DTSTART:20250702T224500Z
DTEND:20250703T012000Z
DTSTAMP:20250702T224500Z
UID:oaMZ6KpkoB
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 134 mins (2h14m)\n\nFive years after the events of J
 urassic World Dominion\, the planet’s ecology has proven largely inhospi
 table to dinosaurs. Those remaining exist in isolated equatorial environme
 nts with climates resembling the one in which they once thrived. The three
  most colossal creatures across land\, sea and air within that tropical bi
 osphere hold\, in their DNA\, the key to a drug that will bring miraculous
  life-saving benefits to humankind.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-thea
 ters/jurassic-world-rebirth
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Downtown\, 2100 4th Avenue
END:VEVENT
